    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newborn rabbit is discovered in a world of reptiles and insects. A king is found lying in his own cold blood. The world is changing, and you have been entrusted by your ancestors to bring direction to the creatures in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite many side-scrollers lacking on plot and lore, Brighter than Burning presents a world of history, personality, and charm. Unravel what you--a rabbit--are doing in a world filled with cold-blooded creatures and discover that not everybody is who they first appear to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced running-focused platformer inspired by classic side-scrollers. Gameplay includes sprinting through levels, jumping off enemies in the air, and avoiding various hazards. Brighter than Burning will present a number of different levels in a variety of worlds, including a hazy swamp, a village of stone, a forest filled with dinosaurs, and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lush environments in Brighter than Burning are drawn by hand and inspired by the beauty of nature. Each animation is drawn traditionally frame-by-frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: All content on this page is in the\u00a0 pre-alpha and/or concept stage and subject to change.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newborn rabbit is discovered in a world of reptiles and insects. A king is found lying in his own cold blood. The world is changing, and you have been entrusted by your ancestors to bring direction to the creatures in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite many side-scrollers lacking on plot and lore, Brighter than Burning presents a world of history, personality, and charm. Unravel what you--a rabbit--are doing in a world filled with cold-blooded creatures and discover that not everybody is who they first appear to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced running-focused platformer inspired by classic side-scrollers. Gameplay includes sprinting through levels, jumping off enemies in the air, and avoiding various hazards. Brighter than Burning will present a number of different levels in a variety of worlds, including a hazy swamp, a village of stone, a forest filled with dinosaurs, and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lush environments in Brighter than Burning are drawn by hand and inspired by the beauty of nature. Each animation is drawn traditionally frame-by-frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: All content on this page is in the\u00a0 pre-alpha and/or concept stage and subject to change.</strong></p>",
